                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The most simplistic and boring game i have ever played.  It tries to make interesting choices, while if you progress in a level, the wall of death follows you.  Making any decisions moot as you should be just moving forward.\n\nTry it on mobile first, it would benefit from \"pick up and play\" and touch benefit, but as a PC title, without using the local co-op method, there is not much point in playing.\n\nLots of polish for a simple game though.   Defintely a good idea for some, but i suggest try before you buy.",
